nts><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>JSR CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUKI YASUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>JSR CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUKI, YASUO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUKI YASUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUKI, YASUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A coating composition comprising either a silane compound represented by the general formula (1) SinX&lt;1&gt;n or a modified silane compound represented by the general formula (2) SinX&lt;2&gt;mYl and a solvent for the compound. In said formula (1) X&lt;1&gt; is hydrogen or halogeno; and n is an integer of 4 or above, provided nX&lt;1&gt;s may be the same or different from each other, and in said formula (2) X&lt;2&gt; is hydrogen or halogeno; Y is boron or phosphorus; n is an integer of 3 or above; l is an integer of 1 or above; and m is an integer of n to 2n+3, provided mX&lt;2&gt;s may be the same or different from each other. This composition is suitable for the production of devices involving the deposition of silicon films or boron- or phosphorus-doped silicon films on large-area substrates.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une composition pour revêtement consistant: soit en un composé de silane de formule générale (1) SinX&lt;1&gt;n dans laquelle X&lt;1&gt; est H ou halogéno et n est un entier de 4 ou plus, pour autant que nX&lt;1&gt; soient identiques ou différents les uns des autres; siot en composé de silane modifié de formule générale (2) SinX&lt;2&gt;mYl dans laquelle X&lt;2&gt; est H ou halogéno, Y est bore ou phosphore, n est un entier de 1 ou plus, et m est un entier de n à 2n+3, pour autant que nX&lt;2&gt; soient identiques ou différents les uns des autres. Ladite composition se prête à la production de dispositifs impliquant le dépôt de films de silicium ou de films de silicium dopés au bore ou au phosphore, sur d'importants substrats.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>